{
  "slug": "homebase",
  "name": "Homebase",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Homebase is the core plugin spine for the Decibel ecosystem. It defines shared conventions, discovery, branch registration, and lightweight workflow hooks so remixed plugins can plug into a common, discoverable base.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `decibel-conventions` (Use when working in any Decibel project — establishes tool priority, directory conventions, and project detection), `verification` (Use when about to claim work is complete in a Decibel project — verify before asserting done).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install homebase@claude-community` from `decibelsystems/homebase`.",
